      "message": "Make the gate end where CI begins\n\nThe documented gate opens with `cargo fmt --all`, which rewrites the\ntree and says nothing. Anything edited after it — a rename while\nreading the diff, a live token swapped for a placeholder at commit\ntime — is unformatted again, with no local signal, and the mirror goes\nred minutes after the change has landed. That is how the format check\nwent red tonight. The gate now ends on `cargo fmt --all --check`,\nwhich is what CI actually runs and which fails instead of fixing.\n\nChange-Id: I5c1f7a93e62b04d8af7215e0cb3946d178fe2b40\nSigned-off-by: Mandip Adhikari <92096340+mandipadk@users.noreply.github.com>",
